  "question": {
    "text": "The solution of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is (where,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> is an arbitrary constant)",
